  displayName: DRAGONKIN
  subtitle: Claw, Tail, Wing, Flame
  role: BRUTE
  flavorText: 'A warrior with the blood of dragons.

    She needs no weapon - claws,
    tail and fire

    sweep everything aside.

    Her size makes her easy to hit,
    but hard to stop.'
